@HD	VN:1.6	SO:unsorted	GO:query
@SQ	SN:chr1	LN:400
@SQ	SN:chr2	LN:300
@SQ	SN:chrM	LN:100
@SQ	SN:chrUn_decoy	LN:100
@PG	ID:hand	PN:hand-written
@CO	Bin counts, run with --bin-size 20 --contigs chr1,chr2,chrM and bins.bed.
@CO	Bins are on autosomes only (chr1: 20 bins, bin 10 has N; chr2: 15 bins). A read
@CO	counts once in the bin holding its leftmost aligned base if it is primary,
@CO	not QC-fail, first-seen (not a duplicate) and MAPQ >= 20.
@CO	a: chr1 5 / 45 -> bins 0, 2.  b: chr1 25 / 65 -> bins 1, 3.  c: duplicate of a -> nothing.
@CO	d: MAPQ 10 on chr2 -> nothing.  e: chr2 25 / 290 -> chr2 bins 1, 14.  m: chrM -> no bins.
@CO	q: QC-fail pair on chr2 105 / 145 -> nothing.  s: chr2 121 / 161 -> bins 6, 8; its supplementary at 205 -> nothing.
@CO	bins.bed excludes chr1 bin 3 (60-80) and chr2 bin 0 (0-1); chrZ is not in the reference (warning).
@CO	Expected chr1 counts 1 in bins 0-3, else 0; chr2 counts 1 in bins 1, 6, 8, 14, else 0.
@CO	Excluded: chr1 bin 3 (BED) and bin 10 (N); chr2 bin 0 (BED).
